/*
 * NO12_ATTR.C  Twelve's attack attributes and random sound lists
 *
 * no12_catt_table has one attack attribute per row, written with ATTR (charscr.h): strength, attribute,
 *   guard type and chip damage, knock-back, damage (pow), stun (piyo), super art gain, hit stop and
 *   marks. A frame line's att picks the row (negative: a new hit). Each row names the moves using it.
 *
 * no12_se_random_table lists the sound effects a frame picks from at random: a frame whose sound
 * code names an entry here plays one of that list's sixteen codes.
 */

